$ heat --help
usage: heat  [--probe X#1 X#2 ] [--fields [NAME#1 NAME#2 NAME#3...]] [--set KEY=VALUE [KEY=VALUE...]] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Solve the 2D heat equation on a square plate


Optional switches:
   --probe X#1 X#2
    default value 0.5 0.5
    Probe coordinates
   --fields [NAME#1 NAME#2...], value in: `T,flux`
    default value T
    Fields to save
   --set KEY=VALUE [KEY=VALUE...]
    keys: alpha, t_end
    default value alpha=1e-4
    Physical parameters
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
